WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.373
Bua ngi SaloneHCM payroll voucher kpɛkpɛ-gɔhun ma.

2
00:00:03.373 --> 00:00:10.495
SaloneHCM kɛ lɔ, branch-nga bi email ma spreadsheet-nga tɔma kɛ̃ hedkwata-hu, a bi voucher pepa yεma kɛ̃ ngi kɔma.

3
00:00:10.495 --> 00:00:20.240
Bi lɔ, branch kɛ̃kɛi nɔ ngi guhaa ndɔ lɛ̃ pepe digital pelei yili kɔtɔ-hu, a voucher kɛ̃kɛi nɔ ngi kaamami kpɔtɔ-lɔi yila kaka-hu bi kpeii leone yɛlɛ ti ye.

4
00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.114
Mu ngi gɔɔ numu-kɛi gbɔwaa-ma.

5
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.405
Ndɔ lɛ̃ pepe pelei-ngi koii bi nɛɛ.

6
00:00:25.405 --> 00:00:36.180
Ndɛ-lɔi kaati-nga bi fɔ lɛ kɛ branch nyandenga bi guhaa bɛ sabu nɔɔ lɔ, ngii bi hakɛ supervisor fele-lɔi kɔma, ngii bi finance gɔyɛi-lɔi kɔma, a ngii bi kaamaa-hu ti gulɛi-ma.

7
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.690
Sɛlɛ-lɔi-nga bi hu wa nya sabu, branch a gua-kɛ̃ kɛ̃i ji.

8
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:18.353
Voucher yɛɛ mia wɔ a i bi lɔ numu-gɔwɔ kɛi gbɔwaa: lɔ-gulɛ-mɔi kɛ̃kɛi wɔtɛ gulɛi ye a PAYE, NASSIT, dɛti kpɔtɔngi a gulɛi hɔhɔ; lɛ̃ kɛi gbɔwaa; a audit yele-gɔwɔ kɛi — ngi bi ma ngi gbii, ngi bi kaamaa, a wɛɛ hakɛ-ma.

9
00:01:18.353 --> 00:01:20.346
Guhaa bɛ, voucher yɛ nɔ ngi tɛkɛ.

10
00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.218
Mɔi yɛɛ a nganyii lewe yɛlɛ ba.

11
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:26.614
Gua-lɔi nɔ ngi fɔ nya-naa a maa-naa nya nya bi lɔ nana.

12
00:01:26.614 --> 00:01:28.571
Branch lɔ-gulɛ-mɔi nɔ ngi guhaa.

13
00:01:28.571 --> 00:01:30.528
Branch supervisor nɔ ngi kaamaa.

14
00:01:30.528 --> 00:01:37.927
Finance lɔ-gulɛ-mɔi nɔ ngi gɔya a kaamaa — a system nɔ ngi kpikpa kpɛkɛ mɔi yɛɛ ti kaamaa voucher ngi bi ma yɛ bi hɛɛ-ma.

15
00:01:37.927 --> 00:01:44.471
Kɛkɛ-gua MoF kaamɛ-mɔi nɔ ngi gulɛi kaamaa — a mɔi yɛ nɔ nga nja kɛ gbii-mɔi ji a finance kaamɛ-mɔi ji pii.

16
00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:48.018
Pɔlɔ-lɔi ɲaande, software nɔ ngi kama, kɛ gɛkpɛi ma bi ye.

17
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:56.989
Huɛ-lɔi bi lɔ. Ngi salei ngi ye ma-hu, gɔyɛ-mɔi nɔ ngi voucher yɛ halei a lɔɔlɔ gbɔtɛ — leta puu ji bi lɔ nana, a bi lɔ ti kɔlɔ.

18
00:01:56.989 --> 00:02:01.161
Branch nɔ ngi akɔɔti-nga sahaa, i guhaa fa, a sɔtɔ-nɔmbɔ nɔ ngi kɛyɛ.

19
00:02:01.161 --> 00:02:03.458
Saha-gɔwɔ yɛ nɔ ngi tɛkɛ ti yele yɛlɛ.

20
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:10.390
A kanɛɛ-lɔi-nga pii: voucher yɛlɛ branch yɛlɛ ti sabu yɛlɛ ma — ɲaande-nga bi tɔgbɔ.

21
00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:15.652
Lɔ-gulɛ-mɔi yɛɛ a voucher ɲaande ji kɔlɔ ngii-yɛlɛ ye ba — ngi nɔ gulɛi-ɲaande kanɛɛi.

22
00:02:15.652 --> 00:02:19.874
A gulɛi kaamaa bɛ, voucher yɛ nɔ ngi lɔ kɔlɔ ti yele yɛlɛ a ti salei.

23
00:02:19.874 --> 00:02:23.178
Gɔwɔ-hu-nga nɔɔ payroll nyapui hoei-nga bi kanɔɔma-ma.

24
00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:29.905
Digital-hu guhaa, kaamaa kpɔtɔ-lɔi-hu, halei lɔɔlɔ-nga wɔtɛ, a mu nga gua-lɔi bi i lɔ-kɛi ma.

25
00:02:29.905 --> 00:02:33.250
Voucher kaamei quiz nɔ bi i hoya-ma Training Center-hu.
